# Terraform
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
# Saved plans are build artifacts, never committed. Both patterns: a plan
# written as `-out=tfplan` has no extension and slips past *.tfplan.
*.tfplan
tfplan
# Terraform reads .terraform.lock.hcl from root modules only; copies inside
# child modules are artifacts of validating them standalone.
infra/terraform/modules/*/.terraform.lock.hcl
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

